# Stack

- Backend: Python 3.12+, **uv**, FastAPI, MCP under `src/gotit/`
- `gotit.core` stays framework-free (no FastAPI/MCP imports)
- Web: React + Vite under `web/` with **npm** only
- Data: Postgres via `docker compose` (SQLite OK local)
- Specs: OpenSpec changes + `docs/adr/` + `docs/VISION.md`
- OpenClaw: MCP tools + `skills/gotit/SKILL.md` — no channel adapters in gotit

# Commands

```bash
uv sync --all-extras
uv run gotit-api
uv run gotit-mcp
./scripts/gate.sh
cd web && npm install && npm run dev
```
